---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Where I Work
permalink: /service-areas/
description: "Your Name Handyman serves Conway, Azalea Park, Dover Shores, Curry Ford West, Belle Isle, Edgewood, and surrounding East Orlando neighborhoods."
---

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Where I Work</span>
      </nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">Where I Work</span>
      <h1>{{ site.areaServed }} &amp; the Neighborhoods I Know</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">I'm based in {{ site.city }} and stay close to home. Keeping my service area tight means I can usually get to you within a few days — and I'm not charging extra for a long drive.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="map-embed" style="border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:32px;">
        <iframe
          src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Conway+Orlando+FL&t=&z=11&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed"
          width="100%"
          height="420"
          style="border:0;"
          allowfullscreen=""
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          title="Service area map — East Orlando">
        </iframe>
      </div>

      <div class="neighborhood-grid">
        {%- for a in areas.list %}
        <div class="neighborhood-item">{{ a }}</div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        <h3>Not on the list?</h3>
        <p>If you're close by, give me a call. I may be able to make it work — especially if you've got a few jobs that justify the trip.</p>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="btn btn--rust btn--lg">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
